  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "夢"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>何明洲</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">兩歲ê囡仔恬恬睏--去--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我kā你ê kha-tsiah-phiann搭搭--leh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā你ê頭挲挲--leh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">囡仔圓圓ê蘋果面　bi-bi仔笑</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親像teh做一場美夢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我mā漸漸睏--去--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī夢中　我看見12歲ê你</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你是一个少年囡仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">穿小可仔大領ê國中制服</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你有淡薄仔緊張　淡薄仔自信&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">淡薄仔囡仔性</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮牽你ê手　m̄甘放</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">22歲ê你　是一个春風少年兄</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">目睭有神　看向海ê hit爿</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你ê笑容展現驕傲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你講你有真大ê理想　想beh去拍拚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit當時　我mā是án-ne離開阮爸母</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">勇敢走揣家己ê未來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮kā你ê手放--開　無限ê疼惜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你坐tī我ê邊--a　笑笑看--我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">32歲ê你　有兩歲純真ê笑容</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我老--ah　老kah規面全jiâu痕</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Koh有真濟話想beh對你講</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你有食飽--無　kám有快樂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kám有揣著sio伴一生ê牽手</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你文文仔笑</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit擺是你牽我ê手　m̄甘放</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我醒--ah　看著</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">兩歲ê囡仔恬恬睏--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我kā伊ê kha-tsiah-phiann搭搭--leh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā伊ê頭挲挲--leh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">囡仔圓圓ê蘋果面　bi-bi仔笑</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親像teh做一場美夢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我看窗外暗淡ê月</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">目屎suah無聲tuì我ê目墘流--出-來</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhbbKWDptaXDINlAkv633rw9bvFANXqldZETCYjF1NRmMCCjkbP1aD5yi3-Z9kPd1BXZcyrEVrh4kyeB8skw1SYKLkShy3LziPppDBWKuwYvHjG3R0RawC3cEgYSo0glOBxaSlxiw7OOw4uXt5KFZ6f-YPcFHu-2YEYtn_eK1w5VDd257pcsK1IT1Vz9T6A/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1353%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhbbKWDptaXDINlAkv633rw9bvFANXqldZETCYjF1NRmMCCjkbP1aD5yi3-Z9kPd1BXZcyrEVrh4kyeB8skw1SYKLkShy3LziPppDBWKuwYvHjG3R0RawC3cEgYSo0glOBxaSlxiw7OOw4uXt5KFZ6f-YPcFHu-2YEYtn_eK1w5VDd257pcsK1IT1Vz9T6A/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1353%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEite1hQ49Ng2M8LKboG32zd0sqsYxFCdyPxGCJ8npeWLzC8R8bJ6ptQU-iWK6C9qZhfMjCsB30eBwmbahF6lsyXlbvbEGfXFpT1E4_lG2ecRGGcg1-boZ4L5Lmgwt7WYIqfFPR_XCoGREByMQvRE2Uer2i5sq7eOK9TIDACWVjjxOZonMYAemGxV-f5U_1W/s1424/353%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEite1hQ49Ng2M8LKboG32zd0sqsYxFCdyPxGCJ8npeWLzC8R8bJ6ptQU-iWK6C9qZhfMjCsB30eBwmbahF6lsyXlbvbEGfXFpT1E4_lG2ecRGGcg1-boZ4L5Lmgwt7WYIqfFPR_XCoGREByMQvRE2Uer2i5sq7eOK9TIDACWVjjxOZonMYAemGxV-f5U_1W/w450-h640/353%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" />